If you have crap luck but positive alignment and prayer timeout (not
unlikely if your only transgression was bouler mishaps in sokoban),
praying can set it to 0 by getting the "You are surrounded by a golden
glow" message. Though you probably need a luckstone to get that
message with negative luck... need to roll a 4 or a 5 on a d(Luck +
6), without a luckstone you can only have a negative luck of -2 for a
25% chance or a neg luck of -1 for a 40% chance at that message. With
a luckstone, you still need -5 luck for the 25% chance and -4 for 40%
chance, which means you probably need to do some altar sacrificing to
fix the problem no matter what.

Anyway, everyone who said you should have just shattered the boulder
is right. Force bolt, /striking, pickaxe, mattock all fine for that
purpose.

